
  ┌─ Drop a stash ─────────────┐
  │ stash@{2} the lanes of the │
  │ graph is thrown away.      │
  │                            │
  │ ✕ the changes it holds are │
  │   in no commit and no      │
  │   branch                   │
  │                            │
  │ runs                       │
  │ git stash drop --          │
  │ 'stash@{2}'                │
  │                            │
  │  y run it  n cancel        │
  └────────────────────────────┘

